SUMMARY:Deadline: NRDC Climate Storytelling Fellowship 2027 (via The Black 
 List)
DESCRIPTION:Annual screenwriting fellowship from the Natural Resources Defe
 nse Council (NRDC) administered through The Black List\, awarding $20\,000
  each to three writers to revise a feature screenplay or pilot that engage
 s with climate change in a compelling way.\n\nOrganisation: Natural Resour
 ces Defense Council (NRDC) in partnership with The Black List\nLocation: U
 nited States (verify international eligibility on Black List program page)
 \nAward: $20\,000 to each of three writers ($60\,000 total) to support rev
 ision of a feature screenplay or pilot.\nDuration: Per project (revision p
 hase of feature screenplay or pilot)\n\nMore: https://blcklst.com/programs
 /2027-nrdc-climate-storytelling-fellowship?utm_source=artificialnouveaugra
 ntdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://blcklst.com/programs/2027-nrdc-climate-storytelling-fellowship?
 utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:United States (verify international eligibility on Black List prog
 ram page)
END:VEVENT
