SUMMARY:Deadline: Asian Cultural Council Individual Fellowship 2027 (up to 
 USD 35\,000)
DESCRIPTION:The Asian Cultural Council's Individual Fellowship supports sel
 f-directed exploration and cultural exchange experiences in a new or less 
 familiar environment\, fostering exchange between the United States and As
 ia and within Asia. SUPPORT: up to USD 35\,000 for a 1-to-6-month program 
 (minimum 30 days\; two or more months preferred)\; single or joint applica
 tions with up to 3 participants.\n\nOrganisation: Asian Cultural Council\n
 Location: Self-directed cultural exchange between the US and Asia\, or wit
 hin Asia. For citizens and permanent residents of ACC-eligible countries (
 including the US).\nAward: Up to USD 35\,000 for self-directed exploration
  and cultural exchange of 1 to 6 months. Single or joint applications (up 
 to 3 participants). No application fee.\nDuration: 1 to 6 months (minimum 
 30 days\; 2 or more months preferred)\, with grant activities between 1 Au
 gust 2027 and 31 December 2028\n\nMore: https://www.asianculturalcouncil.o
 rg/grant-opportunities?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=re
 ferral
URL:https://www.asianculturalcouncil.org/grant-opportunities?utm_source=art
 ificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Self-directed cultural exchange between the US and Asia\, or withi
 n Asia. For citizens and permanent residents of ACC-eligible countries (in
 cluding the US).
END:VEVENT
