 ; a second year may be renewed at ACC's discretion.\n\nOrganisation: Asian
  Cultural Council\nLocation: Full-time\, in-residence graduate programme i
 n the US. For citizens and permanent residents of ACC-eligible Asian count
 ries (US citizens and permanent residents not eligible).\nAward: USD 15\,0
 00 for one academic year\, renewable for a second year at ACC's discretion
 . No application fee.\nDuration: One academic year of full-time coursework
