 ellers from California tribes with an unrestricted cash grant and a year o
 f creative and professional support from Sundance\, including mentorship a
 nd access to Institute programmes.\n\nOrganisation: Sundance Institute\, I
 ndigenous Program\nLocation: USA. RESTRICTED: artists from a California-ba
 sed tribe (federally or non-federally recognised).\nAward: USD 25\,000 cas
 h grant to each of 2 fellows\, plus a yearlong support programme. No appli
 cation fee.\nDuration: One year\n\nMore: https://apply.sundance.org/prog/2
 027_graton_fellowship/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=re
 ferral
